Windfury Totem Aura
    Events
        Game - DamageModifierEvent becomes Equal to 1.00
    Conditions
        (DamageEventSource has buff Windfury (Level 1)) Equal to True
        (DamageEventSource has buff Fire Shield (caster)) Equal to False
        (DamageEventSource is A melee attacker) Equal to True
        (DamageEventTarget belongs to an enemy of (Owner of DamageEventSource).) Equal to True
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Random integer number between 1 and 100) Less than or equal to 20
            Then - Actions
                -------- Normal --------
                --------   --------
                -------- Windfury --------
                --------   --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        debug Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        Game - Display to (All players) the text: debug: windfury occ...
                    Else - Actions
                Set VariableSet DamageEventAmount = (DamageEventAmount + (DamageEventAmount x 0.20))
                Sound - Play Windfury <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to DamageEventSource
                Unit - Cause DamageEventSource to damage DamageEventTarget, dealing DamageEventAmount damage of attack type Normal and damage type Normal
                Animation - Play DamageEventSource's attack animation
                -------- The effect --------
                Special Effect - Create a special effect attached to the right hand of DamageEventSource using Abilities\Spells\Other\Tornado\Tornado_Target.mdl
                Special Effect - Set Scale of (Last created special effect) to 0.60
                Set VariableSet Windfury_Duration = 1.50
                Trigger - Run Windfury Totem Aura Effect <gen> (ignoring conditions)
            Else - Actions
